- The shipped binary talks to org.freedesktop.portal.* (file chooser,
  screen share), but no portal frontend was declared, so those
  features fail with "No such interface" on a minimal install.
  Add weak Recommends on xdg-desktop-portal and
  xdg-desktop-portal-gtk - never a hard dependency on a desktop
  stack.

